                "Purchase." ;
        ecrm:P24_transferred_title_of  <http://data.silknow.org/object/e4512747-545a-3b0b-ab2f-3ca17a145fad> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Worn with hat T.715:3-1997. The ensemble is believed to have been made for the trousseau of a French Duchess who married and emigrated to the US. She died shortly afterwards, hence the lack of wear to the pieces.\n\nThe objects were purchased from Christie's in 1997at £2239.63 for the entire ensemble."@en .

<http://data.silknow.org/collection/461f5c7a-9b6a-38ab-ab63-fe453c1336b3>
